Comment: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:05.70,Enpitsu,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:15.25,Keitai 2,,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fscx190\fscy200\blur0.6\c&HA6804F&\frz0.5453\pos(962.962,254.358)}Interview_Juri
Comment: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:15.25,Keitai 2,,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fscx190\fscy200\blur0.6\c&HA6804F&\frz0.5453\pos(962.962,360.873)}Makina Home
