Comment: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:06.11,Enpitsu,,0,0,0,,

Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has their own world inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd guess Yoshida's and Watanabe's worlds are very similar to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we get along so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But Juri Makina is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt I'll ever step inside her world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.43,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She was mumbling in her sleep on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you see yesterday's?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:00:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Core's lines at the end were so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.45,0:01:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right? It was so emotional!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.91,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, that confession scene, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was crying, the voice actors were so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And that song was great, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.93,0:01:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You talking about yesterday's AbsoZero?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That scene was super frigging important in the original!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.55,0:01:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoma, our hearts beat as one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally cried at that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so good at music, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a nice song.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, Mr. Perfect Pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.57,0:01:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You people are fucking loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But, like, that first episode is still the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That script—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to this, Gokkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning, Ryo secretly changed my ringtone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then her phone rang on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And then out of nowhere it's like, \N“Your eyes make me crazy for you!”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's on you, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.97,0:01:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot I had that song on there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:01:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowpoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds isn't "slow"!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.35,0:02:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So what're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Makina, take your phone off vibrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.86,0:02:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Boring?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Gokkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I like boring. I hate standing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus I don't know to change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I do it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri doesn't listen to music much, see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Makina and Goto are dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I overheard some girls talking,\N and they made it seem like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they've...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.87,0:02:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I totally know what you were imagining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, totally. Just look at that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're talking about Juri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He just looked away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He must be really awkward—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I need to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Gokkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that ringtone\Nreminded me of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean,\Nyou practice every morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I do, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I work out practically every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys should give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{otakus}Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There are way better lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That scene from yesterday's episode was way better in the original!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He just won't shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine. Let us borrow the books, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually brought all the volumes with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hang out after school, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I can let you borrow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that was horrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The timing was just too perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wouldn't laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally would.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you feel my pain, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.85,0:04:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Makina, can I keep your notes\N from yesterday a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but you better give them back before school ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, copying them takes a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I take good notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Makina, your notes are {\i1}too{\i0} good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{juri}And that's a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:41.82,Alt,,0,0,0,,{brown bitch}You've got a song on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:42.35,Alt,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.35,0:04:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, don't underestimate my stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're proud of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, in your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:53.64,Alt,,0,0,0,,See you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, what's that cutesy sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm tired. I wanna skip practice today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You always say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Off we go, gents!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he even knew I stuck it on his back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, it's gotta be—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.13,0:05:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it on my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get my phone from the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems really mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a joke. Weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always been weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She really tried to change when \Nshe started high school, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you come with me to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This page is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What scene is that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not from the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice to have special powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, these protagonists\Nall start with their powers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And that helps them snag the heroine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like playing with\Nmy phone will make me popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, are there even any girls at school who like this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,True, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your worlds need to overlap in some way when you want to get close to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Like sharing hobbies or things to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:07:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, Honjo, if there was a girl in class you liked—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I don't like anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you start talking to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you even talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd be so lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you really want to get close, you have to have something only between the two of you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshida, it's like you're smart today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean “today” my dear Watanabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a good song.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Song?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.85,0:07:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I hate that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so gloomy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, no one likes him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that thing I ordered online was supposed to arrive today some time after six.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you care about the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want my parents to grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have to go to the classroom first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.85,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what'd you buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lemme borrow it some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you want me to walk around with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri, I'm sorry about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,For the thing with your cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,“Hiya!”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The kendo team shouts really loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard Gokkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but I'm not going to run down and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you're not gonna walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Mayu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, Sakashita!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You want rumors to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot something, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,In the classroom—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be at the McDonald's\Nat Ohashi Mall, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that I heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard music.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.94,0:09:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing you just played.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, I heard it during class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean from my ringtone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It only rang for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.81,0:09:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I can pretty much play a song by heart after hearing it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the tune of F sharp...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like hearing that song.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Then—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me the title?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a bonus track or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.09,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, it was good song.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.82,0:10:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to listen to the whole thing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.19,0:10:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was a kid, I used to make up stuff a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I missed deleting one of my old songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You composed that song, Makina?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! You gotta let me listen to it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.09,0:10:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This man is a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri's such a weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in middle school now!\NStop making up things!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, did you compose that, Juri?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! You gotta let me listen to it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aki, you can handle your own dinner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.81,0:12:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri, would you mind playing that little song for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for getting angry, Juri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can play your song if you want, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this man's a doctor—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mrs. Makina—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You like to dream, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad tells me you hear\Na very nice song in your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{picks back up at 14:15}That's at the station mall, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you want to be\Nwith someone from our class?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty common.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's super common.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's super awkward when you barely know them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Like someone you never talk to in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I'd just die if someone like that sat next to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.26,0:14:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like, “Go away!”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I forgot to buy tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.36,0:14:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I listened to the song yesterday. It was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like I could see a whole world inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of embarrassing, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I think your mom's voice was on the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.99,0:14:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little, before the song started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since I listened to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.41,0:14:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There was someone else, too. A guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd totally forgotten! Like, so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he called himself a doctor—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I leave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, forget everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was good, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.73,0:15:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you even care, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Because!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, those drawings on the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,On the plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the red, green, and purple things—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? There were three bottles on the—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Red, green, purple...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the colors were in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just eat without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough, Juri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What else was in that dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There was, like, a robot...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A doll or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.09,0:16:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl, and I think she was a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she met this boy—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,On this ancient-looking tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.89,0:16:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A-And then they—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had that dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I had it last night, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It made my mom so mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me to stop making things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone called me a weirdo in grade school!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They made me see this creepy psychologist!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd say, “let me hear that song you wrote.”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,“Tell me about it.”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't write it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It was from my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You had the same dream, right, Honjo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I listened to the song—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen to the song and the dream gets passed on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.85,0:17:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you think of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.55,0:17:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The world was totally different from ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.26,0:18:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I really like that one scene—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Harmonie's last moments on the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I draw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Honjo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was helping him clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need me anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it had to be—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.10,0:19:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.54,0:19:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't spread your freaky shit around school!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.09,0:19:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The fuck you say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were important!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to act cool, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, how am I not supposed to get jealous when you're with some other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.61,0:20:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Were we ever dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, now. In your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.23,0:20:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Things have gotten really crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the colors were in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The dream and not this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Juri dear, would you mind telling me about your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What else was in that dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.19,0:20:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:21:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl like a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And she meets a boy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There was, like, a robot...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A doll or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she met this boy—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these drawings from your dreams, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There were pretty bottles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Red and green and purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Red, green, purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,On top a ruined tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,On this ancient-looking tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Makina have forgotten about this second track?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.01,0:21:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd totally forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So Makina thinks I had the same dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You had the same dream, right, Honjo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all kind of dramatic, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.53,0:21:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I really like that one scene—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to fix it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.05,0:22:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I should just apologize tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.81,0:22:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.65,0:22:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.82,0:22:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Juri's still on edge?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,From yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When did those two hit it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.71,0:23:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Makina, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Harmonie's last moments on the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.03,0:23:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I draw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.42,0:23:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Honjo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.81,0:23:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.13,0:23:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.46,0:23:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.25,0:23:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.31,0:23:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has their own world inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And Juri Makina's world was, well, really surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:23:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I could get lost in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.39,0:24:11.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2}Those two tiny hands of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:16.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}Have borne a heavy burden
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:23.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,450)\blur2}For long, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.10,0:24:32.06,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,150)\blur2}You smiled at me back then, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.06,0:24:40.60,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2}But I know that later you cried
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.60,0:24:46.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,450)\blur2}On your own, so no one would see you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.65,0:24:59.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2}But don't worry, I'll always
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:02.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(150,150)}Be here by your side
